      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I really don't agree with this as it could very easily be abused. In addition, this would serve absolutely no functional purpose other than being petty. \nIf they are harassing other users it should be purely up to those they interact with whether or not they block them, it is not your call to make.",
