  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-15T00:14:57.459Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "i think it would be a nice feature thing that if i blocked a person they also loose acces to all the things i've uploaded both worlds and avatars.\nso that if people abuse your avatars or keep harrasing people in your own world a block would kick them out of the instance and prevent them from re-joining the world itself. \nanything you've made would not show up in the search bar as well its pretty much like you've disappeared from the VRchat world",
